Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declarations functions main_function

    2 main_function: SANKALPA LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

    3 declarations: /* empty */
    4             | declarations declaration SEMICOLON

    5 declaration: type IDENTIFIER
    6            | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

    7 functions: /* empty */
    8          | functions function_declaration

    9 function_declaration: YAJNA type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameters RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   10 parameters: /* empty */
   11           | parameter_list

   12 parameter_list: parameter
   13               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   14 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   15 statements: /* empty */
   16           | statements statement

   17 statement: declaration SEMICOLON
   18          | assignment SEMICOLON
   19          | conditional
   20          | loop
   21          | for_loop
   22          | TYAGA SEMICOLON
   23          | NIVRITTI SEMICOLON
   24          | function_call SEMICOLON
   25          | MOKSHA expression SEMICOLON
   26          | input_output SEMICOLON

   27 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   28 conditional: DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   29            | DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements ADHARMA LBRACE statements RBRACE

   30 loop: TAPAS LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   31 for_loop: YATRA LPAREN for_initialization SEMICOLON for_condition SEMICOLON for_increment RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   32 for_initialization: /* empty */
   33                   | assignment

   34 for_condition: /* empty */
   35              | expression

   36 for_increment: /* empty */
   37              | assignment

   38 expression: term
   39           | expression YOGA term
   40           | expression VIYOGA term
   41           | expression VIBHAGA term
   42           | expression LT term
   43           | expression GT term
   44           | expression LE term
   45           | expression GE term
   46           | expression EQ term
   47           | expression NE term

   48 term: factor
   49     | term BAL factor
   50     | term VIBHAJAN factor
   51     | term SHESHA factor
   52     | term SAMAVAYA factor

   53 factor: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   54       | IDENTIFIER
   55       | literal
   56       | function_call

   57 literal: INTEGER_LITERAL
   58        | STRING_LITERAL
   59        | BOOL_LITERAL
   60        | FLOAT_LITERAL

   61 function_call: AHVANA LPAREN arguments RPAREN

   62 arguments: /* empty */
   63          | argument_list

   64 argument_list: expression
   65              | argument_list COMMA expression

   66 input_output: SHRAVANA LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN
   67             | MANTRA LPAREN expression RPAREN

   68 type: ARTHA
   69     | JALA
   70     | SATYA
   71     | AKSHARA
   72     | VANI


